# Tax IMPEX (tax.xsd)

Before changing tax XML builders, **read** `.cursor/references/sfcc-xsd/tax.xsd`. Sequences are ordered. A valid element in the wrong place fails import (`cvc-complex-type.2.4.a`).

Namespace: `http://www.demandware.com/xml/impex/tax/2007-02-14`. Root is `<tax>`. Skip empty optional elements. Do not invent tags (no custom-attributes in this schema).

## File

`tax-classes` → `tax-jurisdictions` → `tax-rates`

## Tax class

`class-id` required. Optional `default`. Children: `display-name` → `description`. Names are **not** localized.

## Tax jurisdiction

`jurisdiction-id` required. Optional `default`. Children: `display-name` → `address-mappings` (`<address-mapping key1="…" key2="…"/>`).

## Tax rate

Empty element with decimal text: `<tax-rate jurisdiction-id="…" class-id="…">0.08</tax-rate>`. Both IDs required; they must match a class and jurisdiction in the same file.

Builder: `taxXmlBuilder.js`.
